      <description>My son Charles and I are always looking for giant roosterfish— one of my favorite fish of all. It has a dorsal fin that kind of looks like the tail feathers of a rooster, thus giving it the name roosterfish. It is a member of the jack family and fights as hard as any jack does. The post Adventures South Of the Border: In Search of Monster Roosterfish first appeared on Coastal Angler &amp;amp; The Angler Magazine.</description>
